t` and `deployment_status` webhooks are enabled, or when a deployment emits multiple status updates such as queued/in_progress/success, this normalization makes every status row look like a deploy and the timeseries path later counts every `deployment` kind event. Because the status state is not checked or deduped by the deployment id, the dashboard Deploy total can be inflated by intermediate/failed statuses for the same deployment.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.","created_at":"2026-07-09T12:33:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T12:33:50Z","html_url":"https://github.com/mryfmo/ai-ops-platform/pull/16#discussion_r3551596180","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mryfmo/ai-ops-platform/pulls/16","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/mryfmo/ai-ops-platform/pulls/comments/3551596180"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/mryfmo/ai-ops-platform/pull/16#discussion_r3551596180"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/mryfmo/ai-ops-platform/pulls/16"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mryfmo/ai-ops-platform/pulls/comments/3551596180/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":133,"original_start_line":133,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":134,"original_line":134,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":33,"position":33,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mryfmo/ai-ops-platform/pulls/comments/3551596186","pull_request_review_id":4662994720,"id":3551596186,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTSsiiM7TsQ6a","diff_hunk":"@@ -68,8 +68,16 @@ function parseCsv(value: unknown): string[] {\n }\n \n function normalizeDate(value: unknown): string {\n+  if (value instanceof Date) {\n+    const y = value.getFullYear();\n+    const m = String(value.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, \"0\");\n+    const d = String(value.getDate()).padStart(2, \"0\");\n+    return `${y}-${m}-${d}`;","path":"packages/shared/src/xlsxImport/parser.ts","commit_id":"e36d86